cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Upstream, please cite it as below."
title: "Upstream (upstream-onehealth): an event-driven One Health system for urban streams"
abstract: >-
  Upstream turns sparse citizen and sensor observations of an urban stream into an
  Exposure Episode: an exact Bayesian belief about where contamination came from
  (TRACE), when each downstream area is exposed (PULSE) and where the next observation
  is most informative (PROBE), published as FHIR R4 resources that extend the
  OneAquaHealth Implementation Guide (BRIDGE).
type: software
authors:
  - alias: ishaans04
repository-code: "https://github.com/ishaans04/Upstream"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0-hackathon
date-released: "2026-09-30"
keywords:
  - One Health
  - HL7 FHIR
  - OneAquaHealth
  - Bayesian inference
  - citizen science
  - water quality
